      en: ["Surface area of 2,325 square kilometers.", "Maximum depth of 112 meters.", "Located at an altitude of 912 meters above sea level.", "The lake is shared 71% by DR Congo and 29% by Uganda.", "Henry Morton Stanley was the first European to see the lake in 1888.", "The Kazinga Channel connects it to Lake George."],
